## Architecture Overview

```
ErrorBoundary
├── getDerivedStateFromError()   → sets hasError=true (render phase, pure)
├── componentDidCatch()          → logging + callbacks (commit phase, side effects)
├── componentDidUpdate()         → watches resetKeys for external resets
├── resetError()                 → clears error state, calls onReset
│
├── Fallback resolution (priority order):
│   1. fallback prop (render-prop function)
│   2. fallback prop (ReactNode)
│   3. <DefaultFallback /> (built-in)
│
└── ErrorLogger (static class)
    ├── log()       → formats + stores + console.groups error
    ├── getLogs()   → returns copy of all captured logs
    └── clearLogs() → resets log history
```

